      "docsUrl": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/",
      "anthropicBaseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic",
      "openaiBaseUrl": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "freeQuota": "新用户通常有少量赠送额度，具体以官网为准",
      "needsRealName": false,
      "needsCreditCard": false,
      "verified": false,
      "notes": "同时提供 Anthropic 兼容端点与 OpenAI 兼容端点，适合 Claude Code 与 Codex 两类工具。",
      "integrations": {
        "claude-code": {
          "docUrl": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/agent_integrations/claude_code",
          "docSection": "2. 配置环境变量",
          "os": "windows",
          "checkedAt": "2026-10-17",
          "note": "照官方原文给 Windows 写法。本工具不写 ~/.claude/settings.json，key 也不经手、不保存。",
          "env": [
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL", "value": "https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic" },
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN", "value": "<你的 DeepSeek API Key>" },
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_MODEL", "value": "deepseek-flash[1m]" },
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL", "value": "deepseek-flash[1m]" },
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL", "value": "deepseek-flash[1m]" },
            { "name": "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL", "value": "deepseek-flash" },
            { "name": "CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL", "value": "deepseek-flash" },
            { "name": "CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL", "value": "max" },
            { "name": "CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW", "value": "786432" }
          ]
        },
        "opencode": {
          "docUrl": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/agent_integrations/opencode/",
          "docSection": "2. 运行与配置",
          "checkedAt": "2026-10-17",
          "note": "官方要求 OpenCode >= v1.18.30。整套配置都在 OpenCode 自己的界面里点几步完成 —— 本工具不写它的配置文件，也不经手你的 key。",
          "steps": [
            { "do": "先把 OpenCode 升到最新版", "hint": "官方要求 >= v1.18.30，版本太低可能没有 /connect", "code": "opencode upgrade" },
            { "do": "在项目目录里启动 OpenCode", "code": "opencode" },
            { "do": "在输入框里输入 /connect，然后输入 deepseek 并选中这个供应商", "code": "/connect" },
            { "do": "填入你的 DeepSeek API Key", "hint": "用上面「创建 API Key」领一把；本工具不保存它" },
            { "do": "选择 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 模型" }
          ]
        },
        "codex": {
          "docUrl": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/agent_integrations/codex",
          "docSection": "1. 将 DeepSeek 配置为模型提供方",
          "os": "windows",
          "checkedAt": "2026-10-17",
          "note": "官方给的是「一键配置脚本」：先备份 ~/.codex/config.toml 到 ~/.codex/backup-deepseek/，再校验语法，校验不过就中止、一个文件都不改。本工具不跑那个脚本，也不经手你的 key。内置联网搜索只在 deepseek-v4-pro 下可用：脚本会写 web_search = \"disabled\"，要开就改成 \"live\" 再重启。",
          "steps": [
            { "do": "先让 %USERPROFILE%\\.codex 目录存在", "hint": "脚本要求 Codex CLI 或 ChatGPT 桌面端已经装好、并至少跑过一次，否则那个目录还没有" },
            { "do": "在 PowerShell 里运行 DeepSeek 官方的一键配置脚本", "hint": "这行是从官方文档原样抄的；它会写 ~/.codex/models.json 与 ~/.codex/config.toml", "code": "irm https://cdn.deepseek.com/api-docs/codex-deepseek-setup.ps1 | iex" },
            { "do": "按菜单选 1 或 2", "hint": "1 = deepseek-flash（同时支持图片输入）；2 = deepseek-v4-pro；9 = 删掉 DeepSeek 配置、还原成默认" },
            { "do": "首次运行会提示输入 API Key", "hint": "以 sk- 开头，用上面「创建 API Key」领一把；key 会写进你自己的 config.toml，本工具不保存它" },
            { "do": "在项目目录里启动 Codex 验证", "hint": "启动信息里显示 model: deepseek-flash 就是生效了", "code": "codex" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "models": ["deepseek-flash[1m]", "deepseek-flash"],
      "modelsNote": "2026-10-17 按 DeepSeek 官方 Claude Code 接入文档校正（旧清单里的 deepseek-chat / deepseek-reasoner 已过时）。官方在 HAIKU/SUBAGENT 两个位置用的是不带 [1m] 的 deepseek-flash。"
    },
